WEBVTT

01:34.920 --> 01:37.880
ADAPTED FROM DEMON KING
OF JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

01:37.960 --> 01:40.920
ORIGINAL WORK BY JIULU FEIXIANG

02:12.920 --> 02:13.800
Orchid.

02:15.120 --> 02:16.240
Lord Changheng!

02:17.360 --> 02:18.560
Lord Changheng!

02:19.240 --> 02:20.640
Lord Changheng!

02:21.440 --> 02:23.120
Lord Changheng, where are you?

02:23.200 --> 02:24.280
Lord Changheng--

02:24.360 --> 02:26.760
Didn't I tell you to run
as far away as possible?

02:27.280 --> 02:28.560
Why are you back here?

02:28.640 --> 02:30.720
Let go of me! Lord Changheng is in danger.

02:30.800 --> 02:31.840
I have to find him.

02:33.360 --> 02:34.960
You're in my body now.

02:35.040 --> 02:36.200
I'm afraid

02:36.280 --> 02:37.520
that before you can talk to him,

02:37.600 --> 02:39.160
you would be killed by his sword.

02:42.280 --> 02:43.920
Let's switch back first.

02:50.040 --> 02:51.520
What will happen after we switch back?

02:51.600 --> 02:53.520
Will you take the opportunity
to kill Lord Changheng?

02:53.600 --> 02:54.760
Even if he hurt me by mistake,

02:54.840 --> 02:56.360
I won't give you
the opportunity to do that.

02:58.120 --> 02:59.000
Orchid.

03:03.640 --> 03:04.480
Orchid!

03:07.600 --> 03:09.960
- Orchid! Where are you?
- Lord--

03:10.040 --> 03:11.160
- Shut up.
- Lord Changheng!

03:11.240 --> 03:13.000
- Orchid!
- Stay here.

03:14.240 --> 03:15.480
- Orchid!
- Let go.

03:15.560 --> 03:16.880
Fine, go.

03:16.960 --> 03:18.600
He'll kill you as soon as he sees you.

03:18.680 --> 03:21.400
Then he'll take me back
to Shuiyuntian as you.

03:21.480 --> 03:23.920
As long as I can get close to him
and stay by his side,

03:24.000 --> 03:26.120
I can kill him sooner or later.

03:26.880 --> 03:28.200
Orchid!

03:29.680 --> 03:30.600
Orchid!

03:37.400 --> 03:38.240
Orchid.

03:46.200 --> 03:47.600
- You…
- Hide.

03:48.560 --> 03:50.320
Promise me you won't hurt him.

03:51.600 --> 03:52.520
Hurry up.

03:59.840 --> 04:01.840
If you break your promise,

04:01.920 --> 04:03.080
I'll kill myself

04:03.160 --> 04:04.800
and you'll be trapped in my body forever.

04:25.880 --> 04:28.040
Orchid, I finally found you.

04:28.120 --> 04:28.960
Let's go.

04:29.440 --> 04:30.440
I'll take you back.

04:34.600 --> 04:36.400
Orchid, don't be afraid.

04:36.480 --> 04:37.920
I'm here to take you back.

04:38.000 --> 04:39.440
I believe you are not a spy.

04:40.960 --> 04:43.960
Lord Changheng trusts me.

04:44.040 --> 04:46.080
He even came to Cangyan Sea to save me.

04:46.760 --> 04:48.560
But I'm not worthy.

04:48.640 --> 04:51.280
Why is he so kind?

04:51.920 --> 04:53.880
My lord, please leave.

04:53.960 --> 04:56.720
I'm already used to living
in Cangyan Sea's Silent Moon Palace.

04:56.800 --> 04:57.720
I don't want to leave.

05:00.320 --> 05:01.200
What…

05:01.280 --> 05:02.200
What do you mean?

05:05.040 --> 05:05.880
Orchid.

05:06.560 --> 05:07.880
Is someone threatening you?

05:07.960 --> 05:09.920
Don't be afraid. Tell me.

05:10.000 --> 05:11.280
I'll protect you.

05:11.360 --> 05:14.120
No one is threatening or forcing me.

05:14.200 --> 05:15.560
It's my own choice.

05:16.800 --> 05:18.160
Since I came to Cangyan Sea,

05:18.640 --> 05:20.800
I've been eating well and living well.

05:20.880 --> 05:22.280
The doctors used the best medicine

05:22.360 --> 05:23.840
to heal my whip wounds.

05:23.920 --> 05:26.800
I'm also not what you consider
a lowly spirit,

05:27.280 --> 05:30.240
a traitor, or a spy
who colluded with the Moon Tribe.

05:30.960 --> 05:33.120
I can be myself happily.

05:34.280 --> 05:37.440
Compared to the days
when everyone in Shuiyuntian can bully me,

05:37.520 --> 05:39.360
it's over 100 times better.

05:43.400 --> 05:44.680
Don't speak nonsense.

05:45.560 --> 05:47.200
That's not what I'm thinking.

05:49.160 --> 05:50.040
Orchid,

05:50.120 --> 05:51.760
you're just mad, aren't you?

05:52.560 --> 05:53.640
That day at Yunzhong Water Pavilion,

05:53.720 --> 05:55.600
my brother only hurt you
due to a misunderstanding.

05:56.160 --> 05:57.840
If I go back with you,

05:57.920 --> 05:59.320
are you sure you can clear my name

05:59.400 --> 06:00.840
about colluding with the Moon Tribe?

06:00.920 --> 06:04.240
- I--
- If Lord Yunzhong refuses to pardon me,

06:04.320 --> 06:06.000
do you dare disobey him?

06:06.600 --> 06:08.960
If he uses heavenly orders and rules

06:09.040 --> 06:10.520
to question you and force you,

06:10.600 --> 06:12.480
can you protect me?

06:12.560 --> 06:15.320
If anyone dares to hurt me or blame me,

06:15.400 --> 06:17.480
will you make their soul dissipate?

06:24.440 --> 06:26.160
My brother has always been impartial.

06:26.800 --> 06:27.760
I believe

06:28.360 --> 06:29.600
he will find out the truth.

06:31.400 --> 06:33.200
I knew you couldn't do it.

06:33.280 --> 06:36.760
You wouldn't even tell me
words of comfort.

06:36.840 --> 06:37.840
But the Moon Supreme Lord

06:38.360 --> 06:40.600
can do all of this.

06:40.680 --> 06:42.240
He is willing to protect me

06:42.320 --> 06:44.600
and not let anyone hurt me.

06:44.680 --> 06:46.440
That's why I'm willing to stay here.

06:47.480 --> 06:48.560
Did you just call him

06:49.640 --> 06:50.720
the Moon Supreme Lord?

06:51.600 --> 06:52.960
Are you really colluding
with the Moon Tribe?

06:58.680 --> 06:59.600
That's impossible.

07:02.040 --> 07:03.080
You're Shuiyuntian's fairy.

07:03.680 --> 07:06.000
No matter what happens,
I must take you back to Shuiyuntian.

07:06.080 --> 07:07.200
Let's go.

07:07.280 --> 07:08.600
I said I'm not leaving.

07:08.680 --> 07:10.040
Orchid.

07:14.360 --> 07:15.480
- Who is it?
- Stop.

07:19.520 --> 07:21.440
Ronghao? Why are you…

07:21.520 --> 07:23.040
How can I feel at ease

07:23.520 --> 07:24.640
when you sneak out of Shuiyuntian alone?

08:11.880 --> 08:12.880
Hurry!

08:12.960 --> 08:14.680
Hurry up and surrender!

08:14.760 --> 08:16.160
- Hurry!
- Don't kill me!

08:16.240 --> 08:17.560
I'll…

08:34.799 --> 08:35.720
You…

08:35.799 --> 08:37.240
Are you really Orchid?

08:47.440 --> 08:48.560
I finally found you.

08:49.240 --> 08:50.320
I knew you weren't a spy.

08:50.400 --> 08:51.360
Don't be afraid.

08:51.440 --> 08:52.920
I'll break the spell for you.

08:53.880 --> 08:55.080
Wait.

08:55.160 --> 08:57.680
I'm afraid even you can't break it.

08:58.800 --> 09:00.720
Even if there is a way to break it,

09:00.800 --> 09:02.880
you can't do it.

09:02.960 --> 09:03.840
Because…

09:06.400 --> 09:09.360
Because this way, Dongfang Qingcang
will also regain his power.

09:09.440 --> 09:10.560
She's right.

09:11.080 --> 09:13.040
If Dongfang Qingcang regains his power,

09:13.840 --> 09:14.960
based on our powers,

09:15.040 --> 09:16.840
we won't be able to escape.

09:22.600 --> 09:23.560
What should we do then?

09:24.120 --> 09:25.760
You risked your life to save me.

09:26.400 --> 09:27.720
I'm already very grateful.

09:28.280 --> 09:29.880
I dare not drag you down.

09:29.960 --> 09:32.440
Why don't you take this opportunity
to leave?

09:32.520 --> 09:33.840
No.

09:37.400 --> 09:38.240
I have an idea.

09:39.080 --> 09:41.760
If we extract your spirit
and bring it back to Shuiyuntian,

09:41.840 --> 09:44.000
we can use the Self-Renewing Soil
to create a new body

09:44.920 --> 09:46.560
and turn you back into Orchid safely.

09:51.560 --> 09:52.440
Good idea.

09:52.520 --> 09:53.840
This way,

09:53.920 --> 09:55.280
we can seal Dongfang Qingcang

09:55.360 --> 09:57.720
in Fairy Orchid's old body.

09:58.320 --> 10:00.120
As long as we destroy this body,

10:00.200 --> 10:02.800
Dongfang Qingcang will die.

10:02.880 --> 10:06.040
And he will be gone from this world.

10:24.640 --> 10:25.880
- No.
- No!

10:48.480 --> 10:49.320
No.

10:49.800 --> 10:50.680
They switched back.

11:29.880 --> 11:31.720
You promised me you wouldn't hurt him.

11:38.040 --> 11:38.880
You are injured.

11:39.440 --> 11:40.400
I have an unfair advantage.

11:41.200 --> 11:42.280
Get lost.

11:44.240 --> 11:45.440
Lord Changheng!

12:06.320 --> 12:07.560
What are you doing?

12:07.640 --> 12:09.240
- I…
- Don't follow me!

12:35.160 --> 12:36.000
My lord.

12:36.960 --> 12:38.080
My lord.

12:39.040 --> 12:40.680
Lord Xunfeng broke into the palace
at night with an army

12:40.760 --> 12:42.120
and started a mutiny.

12:42.200 --> 12:43.480
Due to its urgency,

12:43.560 --> 12:46.040
I acted on my own and mobilized
the Dayu and Tieyu Forces.

12:46.520 --> 12:48.080
They've surrounded Silent Moon Palace.

12:48.160 --> 12:50.080
Now, upon your order,

12:50.160 --> 12:51.160
we'll attack

12:51.760 --> 12:53.120
and take back Silent Moon Palace.

12:53.920 --> 12:54.920
There's no need.

12:55.000 --> 12:56.920
I can do it alone.

12:58.920 --> 12:59.760
My lord,

13:00.440 --> 13:02.000
I couldn't find you just now.

13:02.080 --> 13:03.120
What happened?

13:16.360 --> 13:17.280
Xunfeng,

13:17.880 --> 13:20.480
how dare you sit on my throne?

13:27.280 --> 13:28.760
Stop pretending.

13:43.920 --> 13:44.960
Dongfang Qingcang?

14:36.440 --> 14:41.400
SHUYU FOREST, SHUIYUNTIAN

14:51.440 --> 14:52.280
Changheng.

14:54.400 --> 14:55.240
Changheng.

14:55.840 --> 14:56.680
Changheng.

14:58.120 --> 14:59.200
Hang in there.

14:59.280 --> 15:00.120
We're almost there.

15:05.120 --> 15:06.200
My lord,

15:06.280 --> 15:08.000
you've locked yourself
in the room all day.

15:08.560 --> 15:10.200
You haven't taken the elixir yet.

15:10.280 --> 15:11.680
You used a lot of power to repair

15:11.760 --> 15:13.200
the Four-River Pearl before.

15:13.280 --> 15:14.640
You have to nourish yourself.

15:19.720 --> 15:20.880
My lord.

15:21.360 --> 15:23.400
I'm coming in then.

15:24.680 --> 15:26.480
FOUNTAIN PALACE

15:26.560 --> 15:27.720
- My lord.
- Changheng is sick.

15:27.800 --> 15:29.200
- Aren't you in--
- Go and get medicine.

15:29.920 --> 15:30.920
Danyin?

15:50.400 --> 15:51.320
Lord Ronghao,

15:51.400 --> 15:52.680
I'm begging you.

15:52.760 --> 15:53.720
You must save Changheng.

15:54.360 --> 15:56.680
Are there any Immortal Pills left?

15:58.360 --> 15:59.360
No.

15:59.920 --> 16:01.320
If there are

16:02.240 --> 16:03.760
no Immortal Pills left,

16:04.600 --> 16:05.640
how about Guangfu Pill?

16:06.400 --> 16:07.720
My father has a lot of medicine.

16:07.800 --> 16:08.800
I'll go and get some now.

16:08.880 --> 16:09.840
Wait.

16:10.960 --> 16:12.760
Do you want everyone in Shuiyuntian

16:13.280 --> 16:14.880
to know that Changheng disobeyed orders

16:14.960 --> 16:16.000
and went to Cangyan Sea?

16:16.080 --> 16:17.960
Then what should we do?

16:18.040 --> 16:21.720
When he repaired the Four-River Pearl,

16:21.800 --> 16:23.040
his vitality was damaged.

16:23.840 --> 16:24.840
This time at Cangyan Sea,

16:24.920 --> 16:26.280
he was attacked with evil qi

16:26.360 --> 16:27.840
and was hurt by Dongfang Qingcang,

16:27.920 --> 16:29.640
causing his Immortal Pond to disappear.

16:30.360 --> 16:31.400
To save him,

16:31.880 --> 16:34.960
we can only use the life-prolonging
cultivation transfer method.

16:35.480 --> 16:37.160
I'm willing to transfer
my cultivation to him.

16:37.760 --> 16:38.840
You don't have enough cultivation.

16:39.840 --> 16:41.200
If we want to cultivate Changheng,

16:41.760 --> 16:43.320
we need a higher level of cultivation.

16:50.240 --> 16:53.440
But I heard that the cultivation transfer
method damages one's cultivation badly.

16:54.000 --> 16:55.080
My lord, you…

16:55.160 --> 16:56.680
It has been tens of thousands of years.

16:57.720 --> 17:00.120
I drank so many good wines from Changheng.

17:00.600 --> 17:02.400
Consider this as my compensation.

17:52.800 --> 17:54.040
It's the evil qi again.

17:57.600 --> 17:59.480
My lord, I've investigated.

18:01.600 --> 18:03.600
Lord Xunfeng
secretly colluded with Haishi.

18:04.080 --> 18:05.280
This mutiny

18:05.360 --> 18:06.440
was their conspiracy.

18:07.000 --> 18:08.160
They wanted to assassinate you

18:08.640 --> 18:09.840
and take the Moon Supreme position.

18:10.400 --> 18:12.000
I'm not surprised

18:12.080 --> 18:13.640
that Xunfeng wants to kill me.

18:14.400 --> 18:16.360
But why does the Lord of Haishi
want to kill me?

18:19.320 --> 18:21.920
Does he covet Cangyan Sea too?

18:23.800 --> 18:25.640
Since he can control evil qi,

18:25.720 --> 18:27.320
he can use it to control Xunfeng

18:27.400 --> 18:29.160
and the Kings of North and South You.

18:29.240 --> 18:31.560
If he just wanted to be the leader
of the Moon Tribe,

18:31.640 --> 18:33.560
he could have replaced me

18:34.040 --> 18:35.360
before I came back.

18:37.000 --> 18:39.680
He's secretly keeping Lady Chidi's
primordial spirit and Destiny Book

18:40.360 --> 18:41.840
while helping Xunfeng

18:41.920 --> 18:43.080
to fight against you.

18:45.160 --> 18:46.480
What exactly does he want?

18:48.440 --> 18:50.000
Keep an eye on Xunfeng.

18:50.080 --> 18:51.600
I'll interrogate him myself.

18:52.680 --> 18:53.520
Yes.

18:56.840 --> 18:57.960
Shangque.

18:58.040 --> 18:59.160
Yes.

19:10.320 --> 19:12.720
When did you know I was weak

19:12.800 --> 19:13.880
and had no power?

19:13.960 --> 19:15.600
I knew it since the first day.

19:15.680 --> 19:17.200
When she pretended to be you,

19:17.280 --> 19:19.040
she told me her power was damaged.

19:19.120 --> 19:21.080
But I didn't know
about the body switch then.

19:22.120 --> 19:23.800
When I saw it with my own eyes yesterday,

19:24.280 --> 19:25.640
I finally understood everything.

19:25.720 --> 19:27.600
Why didn't you kill me?

19:29.840 --> 19:31.400
The one who kills me

19:32.200 --> 19:33.520
can be Moon Supreme.

19:34.080 --> 19:35.480
Why would I kill you?

19:36.200 --> 19:38.360
You are the most important person to me.

19:38.440 --> 19:39.760
You are like a brother to me.

19:40.240 --> 19:41.320
I would never betray you.

19:44.040 --> 19:45.240
I don't think so.

19:46.120 --> 19:47.200
I think Shangque

19:47.280 --> 19:49.240
is quite affectionate to you.

19:49.320 --> 19:51.360
He will never betray you.

19:51.440 --> 19:52.520
What do you know?

19:53.000 --> 19:54.480
I just know.

19:54.560 --> 19:56.560
You don't understand the heart
and emotions.

19:56.640 --> 19:57.840
That's why you don't know.

20:02.280 --> 20:03.160
You may go.

20:04.640 --> 20:05.560
I'll get going.

20:20.400 --> 20:21.240
My lord.

20:27.440 --> 20:28.720
In order to save Changheng,

20:28.800 --> 20:30.120
you lost half of your cultivation.

20:31.280 --> 20:32.520
Your hair turned gray.

20:34.120 --> 20:36.840
I want to turn you back
into your previous self.

20:36.920 --> 20:38.920
Even if you use up all your cultivation,

20:39.440 --> 20:40.800
it won't work.

20:41.480 --> 20:42.600
Don't be silly.

20:43.240 --> 20:44.160
I understand.

20:44.880 --> 20:46.920
But for your sake, I have no regrets.

20:52.800 --> 20:53.880
You don't have to do this.

20:56.800 --> 20:58.880
You don't have
to prolong Changheng's life either.

21:02.240 --> 21:03.200
I know.

21:03.840 --> 21:05.520
You're not a heartless person.

21:05.600 --> 21:09.040
You risked your life to save Changheng
because you've known him for 30,000 years.

21:09.800 --> 21:10.840
The same goes for me.

21:10.920 --> 21:12.120
- Enough!
- That's why--

21:14.280 --> 21:15.160
I saved Changheng

21:16.320 --> 21:17.920
because I still need him.

21:19.160 --> 21:20.680
I need him to fight against Cangyan Sea

21:21.560 --> 21:23.280
and destroy Dongfang Qingcang.

21:24.800 --> 21:26.000
That's all.

21:30.520 --> 21:31.960
What happened in Silent Moon Palace?

21:40.600 --> 21:41.720
Xunfeng was defeated

21:41.800 --> 21:43.480
and captured by Dongfang Qingcang.

21:43.560 --> 21:44.720
He's locked up in Wind Prison.

21:46.080 --> 21:47.040
My lord.

21:47.120 --> 21:48.640
Should we send someone to kill him?

21:48.720 --> 21:49.880
There's no need.

21:51.120 --> 21:53.480
Dongfang Qingcang is very cruel.

21:54.600 --> 21:56.520
He even killed his biological father.

21:57.280 --> 21:59.280
Why would he care about Xunfeng?

22:03.840 --> 22:04.800
Yes.

22:24.320 --> 22:25.320
Orchid.

22:27.640 --> 22:28.520
Orchid.

22:32.080 --> 22:33.080
Orchid!

22:38.600 --> 22:39.640
Lord Changheng.

22:39.720 --> 22:40.560
You're awake?

22:41.040 --> 22:41.880
Don't move.

22:42.600 --> 22:43.680
You haven't recovered yet.

22:47.640 --> 22:49.040
My lord, where are you going?

22:49.920 --> 22:50.760
Danyin,

22:51.600 --> 22:52.800
bring me my armor.

22:54.280 --> 22:55.120
No.

22:55.200 --> 22:56.960
Are you going to Cangyan Sea again?

22:57.040 --> 22:58.400
I already blamed myself

22:58.480 --> 22:59.760
for helping you before.

22:59.840 --> 23:00.920
Do you know

23:01.000 --> 23:03.040
how badly injured you are now?

23:04.920 --> 23:06.600
In order to save you,

23:07.240 --> 23:08.960
Lord Ronghao used half of his cultivation.

23:09.040 --> 23:09.960
Can you…

23:10.920 --> 23:11.840
Ronghao?

23:12.400 --> 23:13.240
He…

23:16.200 --> 23:17.200
You haven't recovered yet.

23:17.280 --> 23:18.280
Where are you going?

23:18.920 --> 23:20.040
If you don't care about yourself,

23:20.520 --> 23:22.120
I care about my power.

23:33.800 --> 23:34.760
I've made up my mind.

23:36.640 --> 23:37.840
When I come back,

23:38.640 --> 23:41.400
I'll bring you the best wine in the world.

23:56.120 --> 24:01.880
FOUNTAIN PALACE

24:02.480 --> 24:03.400
Lord Yunzhong

24:03.480 --> 24:05.600
summoned you to Yunzhong
Water Pavilion for questioning.

24:11.240 --> 24:12.240
Changheng.

24:12.320 --> 24:14.240
You secretly went to Cangyan Sea.

24:15.200 --> 24:16.360
Do you admit your mistake?

24:17.120 --> 24:18.200
You did it

24:18.280 --> 24:20.360
just for the Moon Tribe's spy
who hid Dongfang Qingcang?

24:20.440 --> 24:21.400
She's not a spy.

24:29.080 --> 24:30.440
You're wise, Lord Yunzhong.

24:30.520 --> 24:32.960
Dongfang Qingcang lurked in Shuiyuntian

24:33.040 --> 24:34.760
and even saved that unknown spy.

24:34.840 --> 24:35.840
He must be up to something.

24:35.920 --> 24:37.920
Changheng sneaked into Cangyan Sea alone

24:38.000 --> 24:39.600
to catch the spy

24:39.680 --> 24:41.680
and figure out Dongfang Qingcang's plan.

24:41.760 --> 24:43.080
Although this is reckless,

24:43.560 --> 24:45.200
he was just eager to kill the enemy.

24:45.280 --> 24:46.320
Yes.

24:46.400 --> 24:49.000
Lord Changheng cares
about the safety of Shuiyuntian.

24:49.080 --> 24:50.680
Switching bodies

24:50.760 --> 24:52.280
was my idea.

24:52.360 --> 24:54.320
Punish me if you want.

25:09.360 --> 25:10.400
Changheng.

25:11.240 --> 25:12.400
Answer me.

25:20.440 --> 25:21.880
Like Ronghao said,

25:21.960 --> 25:22.800
I was…

25:26.960 --> 25:28.360
just eager to kill the enemy.

25:29.280 --> 25:30.240
I was reckless.

25:47.640 --> 25:50.120
I've sealed your power temporarily.

25:50.760 --> 25:53.160
Go back to Fountain Palace
to reflect on your mistake.

25:55.640 --> 25:56.480
Remember.

25:57.480 --> 25:59.280
Don't repeat your mistake.

26:35.720 --> 26:38.080
Orchid.

26:38.160 --> 26:40.120
You finally got a chance
to go back to Shuiyuntian,

26:40.200 --> 26:41.400
but you didn't grab it.

26:42.000 --> 26:43.480
Look at what happened.

26:43.560 --> 26:46.000
Your crime of colluding
with the Moon Tribe is completely proven.

26:46.080 --> 26:48.080
Lord Changheng
must be very disappointed in you.

26:48.800 --> 26:50.160
He won't come to save you again.

26:50.240 --> 26:52.040
He will never trust you again.

26:54.560 --> 26:56.320
I let Lord Changheng down.

26:57.000 --> 26:58.040
Orchid,

26:58.120 --> 26:59.800
you're thinking too much.

27:00.280 --> 27:03.400
You are just an unknown lowly spirit.

27:03.480 --> 27:05.680
Now, you're even labeled as a traitor.

27:06.360 --> 27:08.400
Lord Changheng is the God of War.

27:08.480 --> 27:09.880
He came to save you

27:09.960 --> 27:12.120
out of responsibility and kindness.

27:12.800 --> 27:14.920
Why would he protect you so much?

27:15.960 --> 27:16.840
Could it be…

27:16.920 --> 27:17.960
Am I…

27:18.560 --> 27:19.400
That's impossible.

27:19.480 --> 27:22.480
He's the Moon Supreme Dongfang Qingcang,
Shuiyuntian's greatest enemy.

27:52.120 --> 27:53.400
Anyway, I just want to tell you

27:53.480 --> 27:55.320
that the person I like is Lord Changheng,

27:55.400 --> 27:56.360
not you!

27:56.440 --> 27:58.840
I also hope that Lord Changheng
is the one by my side,

27:58.920 --> 28:00.360
not you.

28:00.440 --> 28:01.800
Do you understand?

28:01.880 --> 28:03.520
The person I want to see
is Lord Changheng.

28:03.600 --> 28:06.200
The real Lord Changheng,
not the one you're pretending to be.

28:18.640 --> 28:20.280
You promised me you wouldn't hurt him.

28:32.640 --> 28:33.600
My lord.

28:39.240 --> 28:40.360
How is she?

28:40.920 --> 28:42.400
I observed her the whole afternoon.

28:42.480 --> 28:44.600
After Fairy Orchid went back,
she was quite well-behaved.

28:44.680 --> 28:46.720
She either walked under the tree

28:46.800 --> 28:47.720
or sighed.

28:48.280 --> 28:49.600
Nothing special.

28:50.960 --> 28:52.640
I see. You may leave.

28:53.200 --> 28:54.040
Yes.

28:54.520 --> 28:55.360
Wait.

28:57.720 --> 28:59.320
What did you call her?

29:04.320 --> 29:05.600
"Fairy Orchid"?

29:06.120 --> 29:08.280
When did you start respecting
this little flower spirit?

29:11.080 --> 29:12.400
My lord, you're not aware.

29:13.840 --> 29:16.280
Although no one knew
about the body switch between you and her,

29:17.000 --> 29:18.720
the palace maids are secretly saying

29:18.800 --> 29:20.640
that when Lord Xunfeng
broke into the palace yesterday,

29:20.720 --> 29:22.520
she was the one who came forward
and saved you.

29:23.120 --> 29:24.880
In order to thank her for saving you,

29:24.960 --> 29:27.160
they all call her Fairy Orchid in private.

29:28.520 --> 29:31.000
I'm also used to calling her that

29:31.520 --> 29:33.200
and forgot the difference
between the two tribes.

29:33.280 --> 29:36.920
It seems like she has become
Silent Moon Palace's distinguished guest.

29:38.240 --> 29:39.080
Exactly.

29:40.160 --> 29:41.160
To thank her,

29:41.240 --> 29:43.240
the palace maids want
to arrange a banquet for her.

29:44.120 --> 29:46.680
But I don't know if you'll allow it.

29:46.760 --> 29:49.400
After all, you personally grounded her.

29:50.000 --> 29:51.600
The people dare not disobey it.

29:52.960 --> 29:54.480
She's no longer grounded then.

29:55.080 --> 29:56.040
By the way,

29:56.120 --> 29:57.760
not only is she no longer grounded…

29:57.840 --> 29:58.840
Pass on my message.

29:58.920 --> 30:00.240
From now on, she can move freely

30:00.320 --> 30:01.480
in Silent Moon Palace

30:01.560 --> 30:03.280
and Cangyan Sea.

30:03.360 --> 30:04.840
No one can stop her

30:04.920 --> 30:06.400
or be rude to her.

30:06.920 --> 30:08.560
And no one can hurt her.

30:09.120 --> 30:10.600
Otherwise, they'll be killed.

30:11.160 --> 30:13.360
Aren't you afraid that she will run away?

30:14.640 --> 30:17.360
She has openly helped me
in front of Changheng.

30:17.440 --> 30:19.800
It's no different
from betraying Shuiyuntian.

30:20.360 --> 30:21.480
Other than Cangyan Sea,

30:22.000 --> 30:23.800
where else can she go?

30:25.000 --> 30:26.520
My lord, you're really intelligent.

30:27.240 --> 30:28.520
Fairy Orchid has always wanted to escape.

30:28.600 --> 30:31.360
But she gave up
such a good opportunity yesterday

30:31.440 --> 30:32.360
to save you.

30:34.360 --> 30:35.440
It shows that…

30:37.960 --> 30:38.880
What?

30:40.360 --> 30:41.760
It shows that…

30:46.040 --> 30:47.680
It shows that she's submitting willingly.

30:48.200 --> 30:49.440
She has become

30:49.520 --> 30:51.120
a loyal subordinate like me

30:51.200 --> 30:52.520
who would die for you.

30:58.480 --> 30:59.440
What do you know?

31:00.200 --> 31:01.280
I'm stupid.

31:02.680 --> 31:03.760
Please enlighten me.

31:03.840 --> 31:05.720
If what she did

31:05.800 --> 31:08.520
wasn't loyalty, then what was it?

31:09.960 --> 31:11.400
Since you came back,

31:11.480 --> 31:13.400
Silent Moon Palace is finally lively.

31:13.480 --> 31:15.200
Would you like to attend the banquet too?

31:15.760 --> 31:17.840
It's a good sign for the unity
of the Moon Tribe

31:17.920 --> 31:19.360
and the revival of Cangyan Sea.

31:19.440 --> 31:20.440
That's ridiculous.

31:20.920 --> 31:22.280
It's a gathering of women.

31:22.360 --> 31:23.840
It's inappropriate for me to go.

31:25.160 --> 31:26.000
Yes.

31:26.480 --> 31:27.320
Yes.

31:27.800 --> 31:28.720
I'm sorry.

31:43.240 --> 31:45.040
- Fairy Orchid!
- Come here.

31:45.120 --> 31:46.600
- Look.
- You're so pretty.

31:47.120 --> 31:48.200
- It's pretty.
- You're so pretty.

31:48.280 --> 31:50.440
- Yes. You're gorgeous.
- It's beautiful.

31:50.520 --> 31:52.440
- This is nice.
- This is really something else.

31:53.000 --> 31:53.960
So beautiful.

31:56.920 --> 31:58.120
You look so elegant.

31:59.240 --> 32:00.680
- Let's…
- Right.

32:03.280 --> 32:04.680
This is too pretty.

32:04.760 --> 32:05.720
It's so rare.

32:05.800 --> 32:07.320
- That's great.
- I envy you.

32:09.520 --> 32:10.680
Try this on.

32:11.960 --> 32:13.520
- Let me see it.
- Try this.

32:13.600 --> 32:15.840
I didn't expect Cangyan Sea's
most fashionable outfit

32:15.920 --> 32:18.080
to look so beautiful on you.

32:18.640 --> 32:19.960
If a stranger sees this,

32:20.040 --> 32:21.960
they'd think she's from the Moon Tribe.

32:22.040 --> 32:24.480
Who would think
that she's a fairy from Shuiyuntian?

32:32.520 --> 32:33.800
It's so beautiful!

32:37.880 --> 32:39.080
It's so pretty!

32:39.800 --> 32:40.840
It's so nice!

32:41.840 --> 32:43.040
It's so pretty!

32:44.320 --> 32:46.800
- Come on, let's circle around together.
- It's so beautiful!

32:57.680 --> 33:00.040
- It's so pretty.
- It's so beautiful.
